  (text "Simple Z80, redrawn from the z80.info test schematic. Symbols are stock KiCad 10.0.7." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "10799dbb-f899-4aec-a1c7-b4f25780734f"))
  (text "U3 is a 27C256, not the drawing's 27C512. Pin 1 is VPP, tied to +5V. A15 only feeds the decoder." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 16.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "71787227-8304-4270-9758-e3928e9a90fb"))
  (text "U1 is the Z84C00 symbol (CMOS Z80). U2 is HM62256, value 62256." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 19.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9daa784a-f7fc-4b6b-8a5c-bd3a666f13b6"))
  (text "No 74HCT14 or 74HCT32 in this library. U7 is a 74HC14 symbol, U8 is a 74LS32 symbol, values set to the HCT parts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 21.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b094605d-af54-4155-af24-6e2664cd644a"))
  (text "PIO answers any I/O cycle with A7 low (use 00-03). UART answers any with A7 high (use 80-87)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 24.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "35e8a244-f299-4421-916e-e486e455d060"))
  (text "8255 RESET and 16550 MR are active high, after one inverter. Z80 /RESET is after the second." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d4c5cc4b-c51b-4ba6-8115-861433557124"))
  (text "C2-C11: 100nF, one per IC, drawn here rather than beside each chip." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c9427bf8-9726-498e-96fd-0fd17c4187c4"))
